#
# parser.add_argument('--native-goal-policy')
# policy = load_policy(args.native_goal_policy)
#
# cloud Leader / laptop: cls = governed_class(...); keep cls(config,...).run()
# or the original --once branch. Move the existing metadata calls into this
# composition; do not call a second run_once or replace the receipt callback.
#
# cloud Claw: return claw_run(...existing profile_backend..., policy,...)
#
# receiver: use the existing `composed` (not the old marker-printing ready).
# A marker printed by the previous ready hook would precede the new capability
# check; it cannot be used as proof that the complete scoped entry is ready.
